## Suggested execution order

1. Fix 1 — Scatter X/Y dropdowns (unblocks Scatter completely).
2. Fix 3 — Heatmap → Scatter deep link (uses Fix 1).
3. Fix 2 — Re-word scatter empty state (depends on Fix 1 to be testable).
4. Fix 4 — Timeseries Y-axis auto-fit.
5. Fix 5 + Fix 21 — Hide disabled controls globally.
6. Fix 8 — FFT auto-fit.
7. Fix 13 — Drift columns chip row.
8. Fix 11 + Fix 14 — Causal/Drift empty states with CTAs.
9. Fix 18 — Upload filter row clarity.
10. Fixes 6, 7, 9, 10, 12, 15–17, 19, 20, 22–24 — polish batch.

---

## Out-of-scope notes

- The scatter backend already returns the right Arrow IPC for HUFL×HULL
  (`POST /api/scatter/points` works correctly via curl). The issues on
  this page are all frontend wiring.
- The "ETTm2 sample dataset" button on the home page works as expected;
  the dataset is loaded and the chip selection defaults to HUFL/HULL/OT
  are reasonable.
- The current FFT visualization is *technically* correct for the full
  dataset (DC + very-low-frequency components), but the user-visible
  result is misleading. Fix 8 closes that gap without changing the math.